      "rating": 1,
      "text": {
        "text": "Trying new dine place which just having soft opening few days ago. It needs a lot of improvement.\n\nThe ambience quite nice..clean, bright, beautiful, each seating got their own power socket.\n\nThe menu booklet is awful.. have several blank Pages and the choice of food are standard.\n\nTaste off beverages are so so.. and the food also nothing special..\n\nI hope they’ll improved and got tastier in the future..",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
